class vsWeakObjectLink<T>
    doc A link to a T that can go away, as saved fields keep it (a quest's giver): an id to find the T by when loading, then a vsWeakPointer to it.
    doc Check proxy and *proxy before using object, as the game does (vsWeakObjectLink<mmoNPC>::Resolve, every mmoQuestInstance method).
    size 0x38
    field 0x0 vtable void*
    field 0x18 linkId int
        doc The id the T is found by when a saved game loads.
    field 0x20 pointer vsWeakPointer<T>
